---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	profile
	title="CV · Jakub Kot · Unbeholden"
	description="Jakub Kot, Senior / Staff Software Engineer. Eight years of remote experience in early-stage companies. Download my two-page CV."
>
	<h1 class="font-display text-statement mt-masthead max-w-statement mb-10 font-extrabold text-pretty">
		I'm Jakub Kot. I build software and run the infrastructure behind it.
	</h1>
	<div class="callout text-article max-w-[760px] p-5 sm:p-10">
		<p class="font-display text-standfirst font-medium text-pretty">
			I'm a Senior / Staff Software Engineer based in Czechia, with eight years of remote
			experience in early-stage companies. I've led a team of around eight engineers and owned
			architecture, infrastructure, releases and incident response.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-6">
			<a href="/cv.pdf" download="jakub-kot-cv.pdf" class="link">Download my CV (PDF, 2 pages)</a>
		</p>
		<h2 class="font-display text-h2 mt-12 font-bold">Experience</h2>
		<dl class="text-dim mt-6 space-y-8">
			<div>
				<dt class="font-display text-h3 text-fg font-bold">Staff Software Engineer, Musqet</dt>
				<dd class="mt-2">May 2025 to present. Cooperation paused pending funding.</dd>
				<dd class="mt-3">I owned architecture, infrastructure and releases for a Bitcoin commerce platform with five payment rails in production, and authored the Lightning payment handler spec for the Universal Commerce Protocol.</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt class="font-display text-h3 text-fg font-bold">Paternity leave and open source</dt>
				<dd class="mt-2">January 2024 to April 2025.</dd>
				<dd class="mt-3">I built Stack Orange, Lofextra and Lofik, contributed to SeedSigner and LNbits, and learned Rust through Bitcoin and Lightning projects.</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt class="font-display text-h3 text-fg font-bold">Senior Fullstack Engineer, Momence</dt>
				<dd class="mt-2">July 2021 to December 2023.</dd>
				<dd class="mt-3">I built Inbox, a real-time multichannel messaging product, and integrations with Zoom, Google Calendar, Gmail and Gympass.</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt class="font-display text-h3 text-fg font-bold">Software Engineer to Lead Software Engineer, OAK'S LAB</dt>
				<dd class="mt-2">March 2020 to June 2021.</dd>
				<dd class="mt-3">I led the company's largest team, around eight engineers, and built the platform behind Crave Delivery from scratch to launch.</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt class="font-display text-h3 text-fg font-bold">Earlier roles</dt>
				<dd class="mt-2">Full Stack Developer at Qusion (July 2019 to February 2020), Web Developer at Qest automation (July to December 2018), and IT Infrastructure Specialist at ALS Czech Republic (2017 to 2018).</dd>
			</div>
		</dl>
		<p class="text-dim mt-10">
			For work enquiries, <a href="/contact" class="link">get in touch</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
